## 4. Shared UI Components

These React components are reused across multiple pages:

| Component | Used In | Notes |
|-----------|---------|-------|
| `<TeamCard>` | Dashboard, team list, browse teams | Compact team summary with KPI badges |
| `<MemberRow>` | Team detail, manage members | Name, role, staff type, location, actions |
| `<AchievementCard>` | All achievement views | Title, description, impact, tags, contributors |
| `<ProfileHeader>` | Individual profile, my profile | Avatar, name, title, location |
| `<KPICard>` | Dashboards | Label + big number + optional delta |
| `<RatioBadge>` | Team cards, reports | Colored badge showing non-direct ratio |
| `<LocationBadge>` | Throughout | Region-colored pill with city name |
| `<CapIndicator>` | Manage members, team detail | "4/5 members" progress indicator |
| `<MonthPicker>` | Achievement forms, filters | YYYY-MM constrained date picker |
| `<RoleGuard>` | Route wrapper | Checks user roles, redirects if unauthorized |

